From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wine.inf: Load Star Citizen's bundled AMD AGS library.

With Wine's builtin amd_ags_x64, Star Citizen reports AMD GPU details and
EAC then flags StarCitizen_Launcher.exe as an untrusted system file
(violation 8, error 30033). GE-Proton11-6 loaded the game's bundled AGS
through the native-version heuristic and worked; the builtin has been
preferred again since 11-7.

Star Citizen is not a Steam game, so key the override on its executable.

https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom/issues/858
---
diff --git a/loader/wine.inf.in b/loader/wine.inf.in
index aa7a6c2..dc268a8 100644
--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -1762,6 +1762,7 @@ HKLM,Software\Wow6432Node\Valve\Steam\Apps\CommonRedist\.NET\3.5,"3.5",0x10001,1
 HKLM,Software\Wow6432Node\Valve\Steam\Apps\CommonRedist\.NET\3.5 Client Profile,"3.5 Client Profile",0x10001,1
 HKLM,Software\Wow6432Node\Valve\Steam\Apps\CommonRedist\XNA\4.0,"4.0",0x10001,1
 HKCU,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\ShadowOfWar.exe\DllOverrides,"amd_ags_x64",,"disabled"
+HKCU,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\StarCitizen.exe\DllOverrides,"amd_ags_x64",,"native,builtin"
 HKCU,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\TDUSC.exe\DllOverrides,"xinput1_3",,"native,builtin"
 HKCU,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\WRC9.exe\DllOverrides,"xinput1_3",,"native,builtin"
 HKCU,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\WRCG.exe\DllOverrides,"xinput1_3",,"native,builtin"
